// expr — daily-ten 17 Nov 2026 (OS track).
// Simulates `expr`: four arithmetic expressions with
// explicit parentheses. 3 + (4 * 2) = 11; (10 - 4) / 2 = 3;
// 17 % 5 = 2; (2 * 3) + 1 = 7. Prints each result, then
// the expression count (4).
fn main() {
    println(3 + (4 * 2));
    println((10 - 4) / 2);
    println(17 % 5);
    println((2 * 3) + 1);
    println(4);
}
